// The sky's EE side: the level's sky variant (0x23d968 and its 35 routines)
// Transliterated instruction by instruction from Veldin's own overlay with tools/codegen/mips2cpp.py (tools/codegen/mkall.py:
// the original's control flow and PS2 float rules by construction), not rewritten
// by hand: the names are the entries', the helpers `ovl_<addr>_tr` (uniform ABI: TrRet). 0x28bd58, 0x28c14c, 0x28c298, 0x28c3c0
// and 0x28c680 are defined as ovl_<addr>_ref_tr, the reference of their hand-written forms (sky_hand.cpp; RAC1_SKY_FAST,
// sky_fast.cpp, defines the names the other routines call).
